{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56047","headline":"送人归吴 · 齐己","name":"送人归吴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"比说归耕钓，迢迢向海涯。\n春寒游子路，村晚主人家。\n野岸纷垂柳，深山绿过茶。\n重寻旧邻里，菱藕正开花。\n（影印文渊阁《四库全书》本《白莲集》卷一）（按：《全唐诗》卷八三八收此诗缺六字，今重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56047.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56047","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}